# claude-sandbox egress allowlist: one extended regex per line, matched against
# "host:port" of each HTTPS connection. Everything not listed is refused,
# including all plain HTTP.
# Apply changes by rebuilding claude-sandbox (go build); the proxy is rebuilt and
# restarted on its next run. See refusals with `claude-sandbox logs`.
# Anchor patterns (^...:443$) so "api.anthropic.com.evil.com" can't slip through.

# --- Claude Code: required --------------------------------------------------
^api\.anthropic\.com:443$
^platform\.claude\.com:443$
^claude\.ai:443$
^claude\.com:443$

# --- Claude Code: optional --------------------------------------------------
# Docs lookups by the built-in guide agent
^code\.claude\.com:443$
# Connectors from your claude.ai account
^mcp-proxy\.anthropic\.com:443$
# Plugin executables
^downloads\.claude\.ai:443$
# Plugin marketplaces on GitHub. Note: this also opens all of github.com.
# ^github\.com:443$

# --- Package registries: uncomment what your projects need ------------------
#^registry\.npmjs\.org:443$
#^pypi\.org:443$
#^files\.pythonhosted\.org:443$
